flowchart LR
 G[Goal / Ticket] --> REQ[Requirement]
 REQ --> DEC[Design Decision]
 DEC --> SRC[Source Change]
 SRC --> TEST[Test Oracle]
 TEST --> RUN[Observed Test / CI Result]
 RUN --> REV[Reviewer Decision]
 REV --> CP[Notion Checkpoint]
 SRC --> SHA[Exact Commit SHA]
 RUN --> SHA
 AGENT[Agent Session] --> RAW[Raw Transcript]
 RAW --> MAN[Evidence Manifest]
 SHA --> MAN
 CP --> G
